# Hazardroot Herbalist (1/4): "Whenever you attack, target creature you control gets +1/+0 until end of turn. If that creature is a
# token, it also gains deathtouch until end of turn." Turn 1: Black Lotus and four Moxen pay for Esika's Chariot (two 2/2 Cats) and the
# Herbalist. Turn 2 Bot2 casts Craw Wurm (6/4) off its own Black Lotus and Moxen. Turn 3 Bot1 attacks with both Cats: "whenever you
# attack" triggers once (CR 508.3a, 603.2), not once per attacker, so only the targeted Cat becomes a 3/2 with deathtouch and the
# other stays a 2/2 without it. The Wurm blocks the deathtouch Cat and is destroyed by its 3 damage (CR 702.2b, 704.5h) though its
# toughness is 4; the Cat dies too. The unblocked Cat hits for 2 (Bot2 20 -> 18).

